<title>SOUTH AFRICA: DJI changes name to Pacific Asia.</title>
<headline>DJI changes name to Pacific Asia.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1996-12-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>DJI Clothing Ltd said its name would be changed to Pacific Asia Investments International Ltd with effect from Monday. The company was previously also known as Delswa Ltd.</p>
<p>-- Johannesburg newsroom 27 11 482 1003</p>
</text>
